  "description": "Live gold, silver, platinum and palladium spot prices, updated every minute. Charts, bid/ask, and 58 years of official LBMA history from a NYC Diamond District dealer.",
  "canonical": "https://bulliontradingllc.com/charts/",
  "text": "Gold\n—\n—\nView Gold Chart →\nSilver\n—\n—\nView Silver Chart →\nPlatinum\n—\n—\nView Platinum Chart →\nPalladium\n—\n—\nView Palladium Chart →\nPrices update automatically · Last updated:\n—\nET\nPrice Correlations\nGold and silver usually move together, with silver amplifying gold's swings. Platinum and palladium answer more to the auto industry than to gold.\nMarket Hours\nMetals trade nearly 24 hours from Sunday evening to Friday afternoon New York time. Prices on this page refresh automatically while it is open.\nReading the Day Change\nEach card shows the move since the previous 5:00 pm New York close — the convention used across the bullion industry.\nFrom Spot to Store Price\nOur product prices are built from these same live quotes plus a transparent premium. When spot moves, the store reprices within minutes.\nPrices are indicative market rates for informational purposes and are not an offer to buy or sell.",
